### FairView API - try the whole flow by hand.
### Works with the "REST Client" extension in VS Code: click "Send Request" above each block.
### Run `npm run seed` first. After each login, copy the token into the matching variable below.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api
@clientToken = paste-client-token-here
@managerToken = paste-manager-token-here
@employeeToken = paste-employee-token-here

### 1. Log in as the client
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "client@fairview.test", "password": "password123" }

### 2. Find the manager's id
GET {{base}}/users?role=manager
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 3. Client creates a project (put the manager's id in)
POST {{base}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Company website", "description": "5-page site", "managerId": "PASTE_MANAGER_ID" }

### 4. Log in as the manager
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@fairview.test", "password": "password123" }

### 5. Find employee ids
GET {{base}}/users?role=employee
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 6. Manager gives Priya 70% of the project
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "projectId": "PASTE_PROJECT_ID", "employeeId": "PASTE_PRIYA_ID", "title": "Build pages", "workShare": 0.7 }

### 7. Log in as Priya
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "priya@fairview.test", "password": "password123" }

### 8. Priya starts, then submits (send twice: first in_progress, then submitted)
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/PASTE_TASK_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "in_progress" }

###
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/PASTE_TASK_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "submitted", "submission": "https://github.com/example/pages" }

### 9. Manager rates Priya's task (BEFORE delivery - blind to the client's score)
POST {{base}}/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "taskId": "PASTE_TASK_ID", "score": 5, "feedback": "Okay work" }

### 10. Manager delivers the project
POST {{base}}/projects/PASTE_PROJECT_ID/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 11. Client rates the project - this locks it
POST {{base}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "projectId": "PASTE_PROJECT_ID", "score": 9, "review": "Excellent, on time" }

### 12. THE TEST: manager tries to change the client rating -> must be 403
PATCH {{base}}/ratings/PASTE_RATING_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 3 }
